  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The option to \"Clear All\" notifications under the Other Notifications tab does not clear the tab of notifications however provides feedback that it has been cleared.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nRequirements - Have at least 1 or more \"Other\" notifications such as a calendar event etc.\n\n1/ Open your menu.\n\n2/ Navigate to the notifications tab at the bottom of the menu.\n\n3/ Navigate to the \"Other\" tab.\n\n4/ Click \"Clear All\" at the top of the menu.\n\n5/ Select \"Yes\" to clear all the notifications.\n\nExpected outcome - The notifications in this tab would be cleared, however this is not the case.",
